  "overlay": "# The firmware build for the QEMU audio comparison (tools/qemu_audio_capture.py, ADR-0021):\n# the PRG32 QEMU profile with stereo output (PRG32 Audio Plus). The QEMU profile sets the\n# I2S pins to -1, and the firmware's audio set-up refuses -1 pins even though QEMU sends the\n# sound over UART1 instead; any free ESP32-C3 pins make it start (4 and 5 are UART1).\n# CONFIG_PRG32_AUDIO_MODE_MONO is not set\nCONFIG_PRG32_AUDIO_MODE_STEREO=y\nCONFIG_PRG32_AUDIO_I2S_BCLK_GPIO=6\nCONFIG_PRG32_AUDIO_I2S_LRCLK_GPIO=7\nCONFIG_PRG32_AUDIO_I2S_DATA_GPIO=10\n"
